<reference id="bacnet-ObjectHandler" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">Server, Object Handler (bacnet-ObjectHandler)</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This component is a frozen container slot of the <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetNetwork</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Bacnet Comm</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Server</uicontrol></menucascade>.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">server<indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">object handler</indexterm></indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section "><p class="- topic/p ">You can create and delete objects dynamically by setting
the <parmname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/parmname ">Create Enabled</parmname> and <parmname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/parmname ">Delete Enabled</parmname> properties to <option class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/option ">true</option>. You can create and delete objects
like Event Enrollment, Trend Log, Schedule, Notification Class, and
Calender.</p><fig class="- topic/fig "><title class="- topic/title ">Object Handler properties</title><image placement="break" scale="65" width="700" href="../graphic/ObjectHandler_0000064900.png" class="- topic/image "/></fig><p class="- topic/p ">To access these properties, expand <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Config</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Drivers</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetNetwork</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Bacnet Comm</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Server</uicontrol></menucascade> and double-click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Object Handler</uicontrol>.</p></section><properties class="- topic/simpletable reference/properties "><prophead class="- topic/sthead      reference/prophead "><proptypehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptypehd ">Property</proptypehd><propvaluehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvaluehd ">Value</propvaluehd><propdeschd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdeschd ">Description</propdeschd></prophead><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Create Enabled</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue "><option class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/option ">true</option> or <option class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/option ">false</option> (default)</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">Enables the dynamic creation of objects.</propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Delete Enabled</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue "><option class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/option ">true</option> or <option class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/option ">false</option> (default)</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">Enables the dynamic deletion of objects.</propdesc></property></properties></refbody></reference>